cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Analysis pipeline for \"Persistence of Non-industrial Gut Microbiota Discriminates Health and Disease States in Industrial Populations\""
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline comparing Industrial and Non-Industrial gut microbiome
  profiles, including depth matching, diversity and accumulation analyses,
  VANISH/BloSSUM differential prevalence analyses, health association tests,
  sensitivity sweeps, and manuscript figure assembly.
type: software
authors:
